<title>USA: Catalina Marketing in $30 mln stock buy-back.</title>
<headline>Catalina Marketing in $30 mln stock buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalina Marketing Corp said Thursday it has repurchased about $30 million in common stock under the $40 million share repurchase authorization announced March 31.</p>
<p>The company reported that it has acquired 1,013,000 shares under the new authorization at an average price of $29.55. Since September, 1994 and including the shares just repurchased, Catalina said it has invested approximately $60 million for the repurchase of approximately 2.2 million shares.</p>
<p>The company now has about 18.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
